Z||000000||Master_Sushi||10-16-2001||04:20 PM||||My black 84SE is basicly my winter car. Its in "OK" shape and looks pretty nice. I'm really jsut wondering what its going to be worth in the spring when I sell it! Basicly the options it has are....<P>4.10 4 speed stick<BR>WS6 suspension<BR>16 inch beretta wheels with pep boy tires (ha, these will be greatin the snow!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> )<BR>Tilt<BR>Decklid Pop<BR>Fierostore ultimate dog bone.<BR>Thats about it for options.<P>The interious is in pretty nice shape. The dash has a few cracks. But I completely striped everything out and powerwashed it a while back so its clean!<BR>The exteriour is in fair shape, the paint isnt perfect and has quite a few of my own touch up jobs. Engine runs great! And clutch is strong and the thing shifts nice and smooth. It has 96k miles!<P>Whats it worth?!?! I might try and get a grand out of it, thats what I think its worth anyway. <P>LMK!<P><BR>OH and also... Would I make more money parting it out on ebay or something? I will do whatever is best for my pocket. I'd rather jsut sell it complete though since I put ALLOT of work into it!<p>[This message has been edited by Master_Sushi (edited 10-16-2001).]||||reg||6
